              <heading>Item 5 of Schedule 1</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the item.</p>
                <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
                <p><i>House of Representatives on 5 June 2014</i></p>
                <p><i>Senate on 19 June 2014</i>]</p>
                <p>(127/14)</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
          </hcontainer>
        </hcontainer>
